# --- External test-corpus containment ---
# Supplied fixtures and derived CAD/model evidence must never be committed or
# distributed. Keep external corpus trees outside the repository and configure
# their locations through the test environment.
*.pdf
*.PDF
*.dxf
*.DXF
*.dwg
*.DWG
*.skp
*.SKP
*.FCStd
*.FCStd1
*.blend
*.blend1
*_import_report*.json
